# Faqat `web/Dockerfile` (compose `web` servisi) loyiha ildizini kontekst qiladi — api/asterisk
# o'z kataloglarini kontekst qiladi, bu fayl ularga ta'sir qilmaydi. Allowlist: kerakli narsa xolos.
*
!web
!replica/design
!deploy/web-nginx.conf
!deploy/web-tls-wait.sh
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/target
web/coverage
web/.metrics
web/test-results
web/e2e
web/Dockerfile
